{"id":"vd-b1-the-flood","level":"b1","n":19,"title":{"en":"Can I Give You a Hand?","vi":"Để tôi giúp một tay nhé?"},"summary":"Sáng hôm sau cơn lũ, Lina gặp ông Jonas bên đống đồ hư hỏng trước nhà; hai người hàng xóm lần đầu tiên thật sự trò chuyện.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b1-the-flood","level":"b1","title":{"en":"The Night the River Rose","vi":"Đêm nước sông dâng"}},"scene":{"background":"street","props":[]},"cast":{"lina":{"name":{"en":"Lina","vi":"Lina"},"look":"woman","x":560,"style":{"hair":"bun","hairColor":"#2B1B14","skin":"#C68E6A","skinShade":"#AD7654","outfit":"coat","top":"#2E7D6B","topShade":"#246657"}},"jonas":{"name":{"en":"Mr. Jonas","vi":"Ông Jonas"},"look":"grandpa","x":1140,"style":{"outfit":"jacket","top":"#5B4B3A","topShade":"#4A3D2F"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"lina","en":"Mr. Jonas! Wait, please. Can I talk to you?","vi":"Ông Jonas! Ông đợi đã. Cháu nói chuyện với ông được không?","ipa":["ˈmɪstɚ","ˈdʒoʊnəs","weɪt","pliz","kæn","aɪ","tɔk","tu","ju"],"start":0.554,"end":5.484,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.857],[2,2.408],[3,3.007],[4,4.492],[5,4.674],[6,4.752],[7,5.065],[8,5.182]]},{"speaker":"jonas","en":"If it's about the fence, I'll repair it later.","vi":"Nếu là chuyện hàng rào thì để sau ta sửa.","ipa":["ɪf","ɪts","əˈbaʊt","ðə","fɛns","aɪl","ɹɪˈpɛɹ","ɪt","ˈleɪtɚ"],"start":6.274,"end":8.944,"expression":"neutral","timing":[[0,6.274],[1,6.397],[2,6.583],[3,6.929],[4,7.048],[5,7.806],[6,7.966],[7,8.391],[8,8.524]]},{"speaker":"lina","en":"No, it's not about the fence. I want to thank you. For last night.","vi":"Không, không phải chuyện hàng rào. Cháu muốn cảm ơn ông. Vì chuyện đêm qua.","ipa":["noʊ","ɪts","nɑt","əˈbaʊt","ðə","fɛns","aɪ","wɑnt","tu","θæŋk","ju","fɔɹ","læst","naɪt"],"start":9.734,"end":15.534,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,9.734],[1,10.203],[2,10.385],[3,10.607],[4,10.893],[5,10.984],[6,12.51],[7,12.64],[8,12.874],[9,12.965],[10,13.265],[11,14.489],[12,14.762],[13,15.127]]},{"speaker":"jonas","en":"It was nothing. The boy was brave.","vi":"Có gì đâu. Thằng bé rất dũng cảm.","ipa":["ɪt","wɑz","ˈnʌθɪŋ","ðə","bɔɪ","wɑz","bɹeɪv"],"start":16.324,"end":19.014,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,16.324],[1,16.397],[2,16.596],[3,17.839],[4,18.012],[5,18.317],[6,18.557]]},{"speaker":"lina","en":"You saved his life. And Mrs. Hayes is safe at the shelter because of you.","vi":"Ông đã cứu mạng con cháu. Và bà Hayes được an toàn ở chỗ trú ẩn cũng là nhờ ông.","ipa":["ju","seɪvd","hɪz","laɪf","ənd","ˈmɪsɪz","heɪz","ɪz","seɪf","æt","ðə","ˈʃɛltɚ","bɪˈkɔz","ʌv","ju"],"start":19.804,"end":24.484,"expression":"tearful","timing":[[0,19.804],[1,19.901],[2,20.214],[3,20.409],[4,21.857],[5,22.052],[6,22.416],[7,22.716],[8,22.846],[9,23.107],[10,23.198],[11,23.276],[12,23.706],[13,24.07],[14,24.161]]},{"speaker":"jonas","en":"Don't mention it. Anyone would do the same.","vi":"Đừng nhắc chuyện đó. Ai cũng sẽ làm như vậy thôi.","ipa":["doʊnt","ˈmɛnʃən","ɪt","ˈɛniˌwʌn","wʊd","du","ðə","seɪm"],"start":25.274,"end":28.214,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,25.274],[1,25.476],[2,25.902],[3,26.799],[4,27.224],[5,27.411],[6,27.583],[7,27.73]]},{"speaker":"lina","en":"Not anyone. Is there anything I can do for you?","vi":"Không phải ai cũng thế. Cháu có thể làm gì cho ông không?","ipa":["nɑt","ˈɛniˌwʌn","ɪz","ðɛɹ","ˈɛniˌθɪŋ","aɪ","kæn","du","fɔɹ","ju"],"start":29.004,"end":32.344,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,29.004],[1,29.216],[2,30.689],[3,30.858],[4,31.067],[5,31.496],[6,31.587],[7,31.77],[8,31.913],[9,32.108]]},{"speaker":"jonas","en":"No, no. I'm fine.","vi":"Không, không. Ta ổn.","ipa":["noʊ","noʊ","aɪm","faɪn"],"start":33.134,"end":35.554,"gesture":"shake","timing":[[0,33.134],[1,33.483],[2,34.712],[3,35.031]]},{"speaker":"lina","en":"Your hands are bleeding. Let me look at them. I'm a nurse.","vi":"Tay ông đang chảy máu. Để cháu xem nào. Cháu là y tá.","ipa":["jɔɹ","hændz","ɑɹ","ˈblidɪŋ","lɛt","mi","lʊk","æt","ðɛm","aɪm","ə","nɝs"],"start":36.344,"end":41.084,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,36.344],[1,36.467],[2,36.754],[3,36.871],[4,38.345],[5,38.54],[6,38.67],[7,38.917],[8,39.035],[9,40.298],[10,40.506],[11,40.571]]},{"speaker":"jonas","en":"That's very kind of you. They're a bit sore, to be honest.","vi":"Cháu tốt quá. Nói thật thì chúng hơi đau.","ipa":["ðæts","ˈvɛɹi","kaɪnd","ʌv","ju","ðɛɹ","ə","bɪt","sɔɹ","tu","bi","ˈɑnəst"],"start":41.874,"end":45.644,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,41.874],[1,42.103],[2,42.422],[3,42.741],[4,42.821],[5,43.811],[6,44.037],[7,44.13],[8,44.436],[9,44.888],[10,45.021],[11,45.181]]},{"speaker":"lina","en":"And your house? Is there much damage?","vi":"Còn nhà ông? Có hư hại nhiều không?","ipa":["ənd","jɔɹ","haʊs","ɪz","ðɛɹ","mʌtʃ","ˈdæmədʒ"],"start":46.434,"end":49.364,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,46.434],[1,46.554],[2,46.724],[3,48.145],[4,48.327],[5,48.484],[6,48.796]]},{"speaker":"jonas","en":"The whole ground floor. Carpets, furniture, everything.","vi":"Cả tầng trệt. Thảm, đồ đạc, mọi thứ.","ipa":["ðə","hoʊl","ɡɹaʊnd","flɔɹ","ˈkɑɹpəts","ˈfɝnɪtʃɚ","ˈɛvɹiˌθɪŋ"],"start":50.154,"end":54.514,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,50.154],[1,50.213],[2,50.466],[3,50.852],[4,52.068],[5,52.932],[6,53.823]]},{"speaker":"lina","en":"Can I give you a hand with the cleaning this weekend?","vi":"Cuối tuần này cháu giúp ông một tay dọn dẹp nhé?","ipa":["kæn","aɪ","ɡɪv","ju","ə","hænd","wɪð","ðə","ˈklinɪŋ","ðɪs","ˈwiˌkɛnd"],"start":55.304,"end":57.474,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,55.304],[1,55.408],[2,55.5],[3,55.656],[4,55.812],[5,55.877],[6,56.151],[7,56.268],[8,56.372],[9,56.763],[10,56.971]]},{"speaker":"jonas","en":"You have your own house to clean.","vi":"Cháu còn nhà mình phải dọn mà.","ipa":["ju","hæv","jɔɹ","oʊn","haʊs","tu","klin"],"start":58.264,"end":60.074,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,58.264],[1,58.373],[2,58.599],[3,58.812],[4,59.091],[5,59.451],[6,59.597]]},{"speaker":"lina","en":"Then we'll clean both. Mateo can help, too.","vi":"Vậy thì mình dọn cả hai. Mateo cũng giúp được.","ipa":["ðɛn","wil","klin","boʊθ","mɑˈteɪoʊ","kæn","hɛlp","tu"],"start":60.864,"end":64.464,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,60.864],[1,61],[2,61.183],[3,61.495],[4,62.904],[5,63.398],[6,63.581],[7,64.036]]},{"speaker":"jonas","en":"Well… I really appreciate it. Thank you.","vi":"Chà… Ta thật sự cảm kích. Cảm ơn cháu.","ipa":["wɛl","aɪ","ˈɹɪli","əˈpɹiʃiˌeɪt","ɪt","θæŋk","ju"],"start":65.254,"end":69.054,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,65.254],[1,66.3],[2,66.539],[3,66.885],[4,67.523],[5,68.417],[6,68.789]]},{"speaker":"lina","en":"And I'll make dinner for everyone. Neighbors should help each other, right?","vi":"Và cháu sẽ nấu bữa tối cho mọi người. Hàng xóm thì phải giúp nhau, phải không ạ?","ipa":["ənd","aɪl","meɪk","ˈdɪnɚ","fɔɹ","ˈɛvɹiˌwʌn","ˈneɪbɚz","ʃʊd","hɛlp","itʃ","ˈʌðɚ","ɹaɪt"],"start":69.844,"end":74.184,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,69.844],[1,69.954],[2,70.085],[3,70.306],[4,70.579],[5,70.788],[6,72.274],[7,72.704],[8,72.873],[9,73.095],[10,73.251],[11,73.785]]},{"speaker":"jonas","en":"Right. It took a flood for me to remember that.","vi":"Phải. Phải có một trận lũ ta mới nhớ ra điều đó.","ipa":["ɹaɪt","ɪt","tʊk","ə","flʌd","fɔɹ","mi","tu","ɹɪˈmɛmbɚ","ðæt"],"start":74.974,"end":78.374,"expression":"happy","react":{"lina":"happy"},"timing":[[0,74.974],[1,76.087],[2,76.299],[3,76.512],[4,76.632],[5,77.124],[6,77.283],[7,77.496],[8,77.642],[9,78.081]]}],"words":[{"id":"hand","en":"hand","ipa":"hænd","vi":"bàn tay; tay; đưa cho","level":0},{"id":"kind","en":"kind","ipa":"kaɪnd","vi":"loại; kiểu; tử tế","level":0},{"id":"mention","en":"mention","ipa":"ˈmɛnʃən","vi":"nhắc đến; đề cập","level":1},{"id":"damage","en":"damage","ipa":"ˈdæmədʒ","vi":"thiệt hại; làm hư hại","level":2},{"id":"appreciate","en":"appreciate","ipa":"əˈpɹiʃiˌeɪt","vi":"biết ơn, cảm kích; đánh giá cao","level":1},{"id":"sore","en":"sore","ipa":"sɔɹ","vi":"đau, nhức; vết loét","level":2}],"focus":{"title":"Đề nghị giúp đỡ và cảm ơn","pattern":"Can I give you a hand? · Is there anything I can do? · Let me… · That's very kind of you. · I really appreciate it. · Don't mention it.","explain":"Đề nghị giúp: \"Can I give you a hand (with…)?\", \"Is there anything I can do?\", \"Let me carry that.\" Nhận lời và cảm ơn: \"That's very kind of you.\", \"I really appreciate it.\" Đáp lại lời cảm ơn khiêm tốn: \"Don't mention it.\" / \"It was nothing.\"","keys":["give you a hand","anything i can do","let me","very kind of you","i really appreciate it","don't mention it"],"lines":[5,6,8,9,12,15]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-b1-the-flood.mp3","v":"938c1dc6b6","duration":79.464,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}